地味な色デザイン)にチャック付きの灰色パーカーを羽織って下はデニムです(特にこだわりないので派手でなければ適当で大丈夫です)\n・左手の描写がある際はセピアさんとお揃いの指輪をさせて欲しいです\n\n\n夢イラストということで指定が多くて申し訳ないのですがよろしくお願いします\n\nhttps://osewaya.jp/products/ayrg0453", "nc": 1, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@v_OLIVE_v/works/13", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 3508494, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/b3cc100a/uploads/origins/5eeca921-2583-43df-9fd1-e350d72a320b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9f3a3d4ee291176d48bd9d4958381903", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/b3cc100a/uploads/origins/5eeca921-2583-43df-9fd1-e350d72a320b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9f3a3d4ee291176d48bd9d4958381903, https://si.imgix.net/b3cc100a/uploads/origins/5eeca921-2583-43df-9fd1-e350d72a320b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=cc0148f67f8d556626e6b8c2d32be461 2x, https://si.imgix.net/b3cc100a/uploads/origins/5eeca921-2583-43df-9fd1-e350d72a320b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7d38531cd5b77ec37bc5be3feeecbe14 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": true, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/b3cc100a/uploads/origins/5eeca921-2583-43df-9fd1-e350d72a320b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=ebea52c6d5d1e96877e8350bf11df785", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/b3cc100a/uploads/origins/5eeca921-2583-43df-9fd1-e350d72a320b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=ebea52c6d5d1e96877e8350bf11df785, https://si.imgix.net/b3cc100a/uploads/origins/5eeca921-2583-43df-9fd1-e350d72a320b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=f1c951501f226eb3dfb9154b468407d1 2x, https://si.imgix.net/b3cc100a/up